{
"HanafudaIntroDialogue":{
    "start": 
    {
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "The box spins around, making you dizzy, and then stops. Kronos kicks you out of the box and in an instance your view changes to a path surounded of bambu with a shrine at the end of it",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI2"
    },
    "HI2": 
    {
        "speaker": "Player",
        "text": "Wow *looks around with shiny eyes*, this is so cozy!",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI3",
        "Character":{
            "ImageKey":"protagonist",
            "frame":3,
            "x":460,
            "y":250,
            "scaleX":1,
            "scaleY":1,
            "rotation":0,
            "emoticon":5,
            "emoticonY":40
        }
    },
    "HI3":
    {
        "speaker": "Kronos",
        "text": "Don't let the view, neither the one living here, fool you. Many pretty things are dangerous.",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI4",
        "Character":{
            "ImageKey":"kronos",
            "frame":1,
            "x":1060,
            "y":250,
            "scaleX":1,
            "scaleY":1,
            "rotation":0,
            "emoticon":"none",
            "emoticonY":0
        }
    },
    "HI4": 
    {
        "speaker": "Player",
        "text": "what do you mean? Are there ninjas in the forest? ancient traps? Is the only food here cake or something?",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI5",
        "Character":{
            "ImageKey":"protagonist",
            "frame":3,
            "x":460,
            "y":250,
            "scaleX":1,
            "scaleY":1,
            "rotation":0,
            "emoticon":1,
            "emoticonY":40
        }
    },
    "HI5": 
    {
        "speaker": "Kronos",
        "text": "Oh you wish it was cake indigestion your worst worry. Nope it's something worse",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI6",
        "Character":{
            "ImageKey":"kronos",
            "frame":2,
            "x":1060,
            "y":250,
            "scaleX":1,
            "scaleY":1,
            "rotation":0,
            "emoticon":8,
            "emoticonY":0
        }
    },
    "HI6": 
    {
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "Just when Kronos finish his ominous sentence, a slender figure appears from behind the shrine and in a blink of an eye it's behind Kronos",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI7",
        "Character":"none"
    },
    "HI7": 
    {
        "speaker": "Benten",
        "text": "Oh it's you dear Kronos, You came back. How delightful!",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI8",
        "Character":{
            "ImageKey":"benten",
            "frame":1,
            "x":760,
            "y":250,
            "scaleX":1,
            "scaleY":1,
            "rotation":0,
            "emoticon":5,
            "emoticonY":-80,
            "emoticonX":-20
        }
    },
    "HI8": 
    {
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "The figure's voice is soft but doesn't hesistate. You watch as the figure invades (a lot) kronos personal space, Kronos stays still without uttering a word and you get the impression he wants to go back into the box.",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI9"
    },
    "HI9": 
    {
        "speaker": "Player",
        "text": "eh.. Kronos... who's this?",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI10",
        "Character":{
            "ImageKey":"protagonist",
            "frame":4,
            "x":460,
            "y":250,
            "scaleX":1,
            "scaleY":1,
            "rotation":0,
            "emoticon":1,
            "emoticonY":40
        }
    },
    "HI10": 
    {
        "speaker": "Kronos",
        "text": "*sighs* This is Benten. Benten, meet my new friend",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI11",
