            "ImageKey":"kronos",
            "frame":1,
            "x":1060,
            "y":250,
            "scaleX":1,
            "scaleY":1,
            "rotation":0,
            "emoticon":"none",
            "emoticonY":0
        }
    },
    "HI11": 
    {
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "Benten didn't even realized you were there. When she notices your presence, she hides behind Kronos, although she fails to do so because of her height.",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI12",
        "Character":{
            "ImageKey":"benten",
            "frame":0,
            "x":760,
            "y":250,
            "scaleX":1,
            "scaleY":1,
            "rotation":0,
            "emoticon":2,
            "emoticonY":-160,
            "emoticonX":-60
        }
    },
    "HI12": 
    {
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "A moment after, she takes a peek at you, her expression rather flustered, and quickly she goes back into hiding. Time waiting for her increases as does your confussion.",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI13",
        "Character":{
            "ImageKey":"benten",
            "frame":3,
            "x":760,
            "y":250,
            "scaleX":1,
            "scaleY":1,
            "rotation":0,
            "emoticon":"none",
            "emoticonY":0
        }
    },
    "HI13": 
    {
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "Finally, she comes out and starts walking towards you. She carries herself with grace before stopping in front of you.",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI13-1",
        "Character":"none"
    },

    "HI13-1": 
    {
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "She lowers her voice and speaks gently.",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI14",
        "Character":"none"
    },

    "HI14": 
    {
        "speaker": "Benten",
        "text": "Pleased to meet you, handsome. I'm Beten, I like the flow of things. Pardon my behaviour earlier, I really hope that I didn't scare you.",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI15",
        "Character":{
            "ImageKey":"benten",
            "frame":1,
            "x":760,
            "y":250,
            "scaleX":1,
            "scaleY":1,
            "rotation":0,
            "emoticon":"none",
            "emoticonY": 20,
            "emoticonX":40 
        }
    },
    "HI15": 
    {
        "speaker": "Player",
        "text": "Hi, miss Benten, I'm a friend of Kronos. The pleasure is mine. I don't know what the flow of things is but good for you!",
        "animation": "true",
        "next": "HI16",
        "Character":{
            "ImageKey":"protagonist",
            "frame":2,
            "x":460,
            "y":250,
            "scaleX":1,
            "scaleY":1,
            "rotation":0,
            "emoticon":4,
            "emoticonY":70
        }
    },
    "HI16": 
    {
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "When you mention her name, she makes a bashful expression. You are unsure of how to act around her so for now you stick to being friendly and trying not to be awkward",
